# NrgOpt Website

## Environment Variables

Create a `.env` file in the project root with the following variables:

```env
# SMTP Configuration (QQ Mail)
SMTP_USER=your-email@qq.com
SMTP_PASS=your-smtp-authorization-code
CONTACT_TO=your-receiving-email@qq.com
```

> ⚠️ **Never commit `.env` to Git.** It is already ignored in `.gitignore`.

## Deployment

This site is deployed on Vercel. API functions in `/api/` require the above environment variables to be configured in the Vercel dashboard.

## Local Development

```bash
npm install
# Set up .env file, then:
vercel dev
```
